OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrests after homes
OL,4,Aevacuated in search
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have arrested two more people
OL,7,Ffollowing the evacuation of homes in
OL,8,FHigh Green, Sheffield.
OL,10,FNearby residents were told to leave on
OL,11,FTuesday while Army bomb disposal
OL,12,Fexperts and police searched a property
OL,13,Fin Mapplebeck Road, where they
OL,14,Frecovered suspected chemicals, drugs
OL,15,Fand weapons.
OL,17,FRachel Hale, 35 and of Mapplebeck Road,
OL,18,Fwas charged with an offence under the
OL,19,FExplosive Substances Act 1883 and
OL,20,Fremanded in custody at Sheffield
OL,21,FMagistrates' Court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
