OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrests after homes
OL,4,Aevacuated in search
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, South Yorkshire Police said
OL,7,Fofficers had arrested a man in his 60s
OL,8,Fand a woman in her 50s under the
OL,9,FExplosive Substances Act and on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of drug offences. Both have
OL,11,Fsince been bailed pending further
OL,12,Finquiries.
